  "slug": "catering-order-incident-report-form",
  "title": "Catering Order Incident Report Form",
  "subtitle": "Record an off-premise catering failure - transit, temperature, shortage, or allergen exposure concern - and route the decision to the manager on duty.",
  "description": "An original incident record for off-premise catering. It captures incident identity and where in the delivery it occurred, the factual account with transit and temperature history, the immediate response including any decision to withhold food, qualified review, corrective actions with verification, and a closeout naming residual risk.",
  "use_case": "Use when a catering delivery fails: the vehicle is late or breaks down, a holding temperature falls outside the venue standard, an item is short or missing, site access is refused, or a guest raises an allergen concern. The report closes only after the manager on duty reviews it and corrective actions are verified.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
  "sections": [
